  "description_snippet": "**VULNERABILITY DETAILS**   \n  \nIt is possible to load some extension JavaScript resources from a regular webpage by adding setters to `Object.prototype`. In principle, only a couple of such resources are loaded by default when e.g. `chrome.webstore.onDownloadProgress` is accessed from a webpage. Ho"
